<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson jumps on restructuring news.</title>
<headline>Ericsson jumps on restructuring news.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Swedish telecoms firm LM Ericsson AB rose on news the company would streamline its business operations into three divisions from five.</p>
<p>At 1100 GMT the share traded at 205 crowns, up from 201 before the announcement.</p>
<p>Ericsson said it will cut its divisions from five to three -- telephones and terminals, mobile systems, and information communications systems -- in an internal restructure effective next January 1.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
